{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114100021155-1114_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261113212127\"/><p>福島第一核電站仍存放大量核污水。</p><p>日本東京電力公司周五（13日）完成福島第一核電站第25輪核污水排海，2023年8月迄今累計排放核污水19.6萬噸。</p><p>東電表示，2026財年第7輪核污染水排放上月26日開始，至周五結束，總共排放核污水7,835噸，含放射性氚總量約1.4萬億貝克勒爾。截至上月29日，福島第一核電站內儲水罐還儲存核污染水約122萬噸。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:18:03.189089+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T02:00:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:38.160006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:11:19.922503+00:00","content_hash":"ae29f63217b054d428477d3e9573acd681e65b74c6fb9d3c66f5ed0c60b654ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}